{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "c70e922e231f46921eeed0f44ad5b015609a928022589f6bd040ece72845abca", "ja": "私たちにおまかせ！", "zh": "就交给我们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3a3fbce91ea162facaf545efbe604b6996572925bb19af2d0c222911c9182da6", "ja": "レンタル会議場で、記念公演について意見を\n出し合うアイドル達。話し合いは順調、途中\n様子を見に来たプロデューサーにも「ここは\n任せて！」と頼もしいところを見せる。", "zh": "在租借的会议场地里，偶像们就纪念公演\n交换着意见。讨论进行得很顺利，中途前来\n查看情况的制作人也看到了她们可靠的一面：\n“这里就交给我们吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dff76993f1e7485e8e6171e438b146743263818ee187e353da7a0f37d815cb4f", "ja": "（今日は記念公演のメンバーと、\n劇場外のレンタル会議場で打ち合わせだ）", "zh": "（今天要和参加纪念公演的成员们，在剧场外租借的会议场地开会）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ba861a181ff0ce57f15ffa6b10e0ae114ac08a8de4b32991a86695a36f342c1b", "ja": "（忙しくてあまり時間が取れないけど、\nせめて顔だけでも見ておきたいからな……！）", "zh": "（虽然很忙，抽不出太多时间，但至少也想见上一面……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "093d33a64dcf8af703bed5f84f05882f8484f38071c7aa0f23187cea79ce5643", "ja": "ただ斬新なだけでは、難解な演出に\nなってしまうかと……やはりある程度は……。", "zh": "光是新颖的话，可能会变成难以理解的演出……果然还是得在一定程度上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1003_null", "source_sha256": "ca1bb861cd7ac91e1d1642d22016a45edc150633af952bdade736af5f0946b1e", "ja": "ガラッ", "zh": "哗啦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4401aecafa904c1a678c37bc4be3f166d13b636042252ece81e0c98ddf72fe0d", "ja": "っと……みんな揃ってるな。お疲れさま。", "zh": "嗯……大家都到齐了啊。辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2e02f08a5d40d67941d90b9635f148e8b68f43977b7b5484cbafdd2f50572e93", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまですぅ。\n先に話し合い、始めちゃってました。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n我们已经先开始讨论了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "709a6654449dba60302e0d555cf9f72cfe93dd4425b09c8f54190bb2bba02fd3", "ja": "おっ、そうか！　自主的に動いてくれてありがたいよ。\nこの後、すぐに劇場に行かないとだから……。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊！谢谢你们主动行动起来。\n接下来我得马上去剧场了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "79f04e6817df0d95e1cb006ec8e8566ce95e938cd7a73f6e52d6ecd3b1ac85db", "ja": "劇場の工事ですよね？　楽しみだな～♪\n今はみんなで、ライブの演出案を出していたんですよ。", "zh": "是剧场的施工对吧？真期待啊～♪\n我们刚才正在一起讨论演唱会的演出方案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "8febc6204cdc77a83bceb15a194c736041e8b82202a64192d59c445fecd1c48c", "ja": "公演のテーマ、『新しい出会い』なんですよね？\n新しいファンのみんなはもちろんですけど……。", "zh": "公演的主题是“新的邂逅”，对吧？\n当然也希望让新来的粉丝们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "bfce83110f1abafe1e230a58593221ae53137718a256d1f1ca112407a18ac8e0", "ja": "ずっとボクたちを応援してくれてるファンにも、\nボクたちの新しい魅力と出会ってもらいたいんです！", "zh": "我也希望一直为我们加油的粉丝们，能发现我们全新的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3dfbb211712e1d2fb587a1ebb0b54fbf986e0b831d5a0d777af9a27b7038527e", "ja": "自由にアイディアを出し合って、\n上手くまとまらないものかと、試行錯誤しています。", "zh": "大家自由地交换想法，试着看看能不能顺利归纳起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ca549b6f5b711a986b97c429d1899aae3806442a77c95ab7f5515b17f540e0fc", "ja": "なるほど……そういえば、これくらいの初期段階から\nみんなに任せるのは、あまりなかったよな。", "zh": "原来如此……这么说来，还真没怎么在这种初期阶段就把事情交给大家呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "97d70135c2b9f16e8502e008e2a2ec4ab8b752eb4dac44c04b34be08ca6d0ac6", "ja": "どういう公演になるのか……。\nいちファンとして、楽しみにさせてもらうよ！", "zh": "会变成一场怎样的公演呢……  \n就让我以一名粉丝的身份，拭目以待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b0e4c7d5356336394deb4cd24371674abe0e8ac6d2cd9a7eef6972a896e27f9a", "ja": "それは……まさか、牽制しているのですか？\n下手なものは見せるな、と……？", "zh": "那是……难道是在警告我吗？\n意思是……不许拿差劲的东西给你看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4fbca9577cd2eaf05db953a428d110ac51dda64af1b335eecc94e8fca38f6fcb", "ja": "い、いや、そんなつもりはないよ！\n本当に素直な気持ちで、楽しみにしているだけで。", "zh": "不、不是，我没有那个意思！\n我只是发自内心地期待着而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bc3ec806e46255bd2d3e077f4c4e5a063c9f5c0dcb8b04cb57cc7c9fc13a1ae0", "ja": "ま、任せてくださいっ！　{$P$}が\nあっと驚くようなステージにしてみせますぅ……！", "zh": "请、请交给我吧！我一定会打造出让{$P$}大吃一惊的舞台……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "8f7954f634632da1220a247cd801da8e671f3df0507ad18a82bffa4472e06392", "ja": "うんうん！　みんなで、{$P$}さんが\n腰を抜かしちゃうような公演にしようね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！大家一起努力，把演出办得让{$P$}先生都惊讶得腿软吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a0fdde324adbe32a79d4ccbff5e692503797155e69ce64666ec6e5df11369fbd", "ja": "えっ、そこまで……？", "zh": "诶，要做到那种程度……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "75870359c0a712dd8eef12ddb401cf2cf2d632abe6bf7c35bd573f510b04d854", "ja": "とにかく、こっちはボクたちに任せて、\n{$P$}は劇場の方、お願いします！", "zh": "总之，这边就交给我们吧，\n{$P$}，剧场那边就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "429126dc05db19d7e8287d856a074e99e8d3ff067f4c82ba630259905d0f3ad8", "ja": "劇場の改修は、大切なお仕事です。\nくれぐれも、手抜かりなきよう。", "zh": "剧场的改修是非常重要的工作。\n还请务必不要有任何疏漏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cfa0cd45f8549802cf526f303be3af6d9697d237b05741081e26e41751dcae99", "ja": "はは……よし、わかった！\nこっちは一旦任せるから、よろしく頼んだよ。", "zh": "哈哈……好，明白了！\n这边就先交给你了，拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
